**Description of the problem including expected versus actual behavior**:
Attempts to Restore a single index from a Snapshot (containing a Data Stream as well as normal indices) fail with a NullPointerException (stacktrace below); would expect the restore request to be successfully acknowledged and processed.

**Steps to reproduce**:

Please include a *minimal* but *complete* recreation of the problem,
including (e.g.) index creation, mappings, settings, query etc.  The easier
you make for us to reproduce it, the more likely that somebody will take the
time to look at it.

 1. Create "basic" index containing a document
```
PUT my-index/_doc/1
{ "foo": "bar" }
```
 2. Create a Data Stream (with template and ILM) containing a document
```
PUT _ilm/policy/my-data-stream-ilm-policy
{
    "policy": {
        "phases": {
            "warm": {
                "min_age": "0ms",
                "actions": {
                    "shrink": {
                        "number_of_shards": 1
                    },
                    "forcemerge": {
                        "max_num_segments": 1
                    },
                    "set_priority": {
                        "priority": 50
                    },
                    "readonly": {}
                }
            },
            "hot": {
                "min_age": "0ms",
                "actions": {
                    "rollover": {
                        "max_age": "1d",
                        "max_docs": "10000000"
                    },
                    "set_priority": {
                        "priority": 100
                    }
                }
            },
            "delete": {
                "min_age": "20d",
                "actions": {
                    "wait_for_snapshot": {
                        "policy": "s3-hourly-snapshot"
                    },
                    "delete": {}
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

POST _index_template/my-data-stream
{
  "index_patterns": [
    "my-data-stream*"
  ],
  "data_stream": {},
  "template": {
    "settings": {
      "lifecycle.name": "my-data-stream-ilm-policy",
      "lifecycle.rollover_alias": "my-data-stream-write"
    }
  },
  "version": 1
}

PUT _data_stream/my-data-stream

POST my-data-stream/_doc
{  "bar": "baz" }
```
 3. Create SLM Repository and Policy including index and Data Stream
```
PUT _snapshot/s3_repository
{
  "type": "s3",
  "settings": {"bucket": "my-bucket", "base_path": "my-path", "server_side_encryption": true, "storage_class": "standard" }
}

PUT _slm/policy/s3-hourly-snapshot
{
   "schedule": "0 0 * * * ?",
   "name": "<snapshot-{now{yyyy.MM.dd-HH}}>",
   "repository": "s3_repository",
   "retention": { "expire_after": "10d"  },
   "config": { "indices": [ "my-index*", "my-data-stream" ] }
}
```
 4. Perform Snapshot
```
POST /_snapshot/s3_repository/my-snapshot
```
 5. Attempt Restore (once Snapshot completed and verified)
```
POST /_snapshot/s3_repository/my-snapshot/_restore
{ "indices": [ "my-index" ] }
```

**Provide logs (if relevant)**:

